                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                        "entry_id": "cdf586e1-c1e0-37ba-a457-1d3a8f0c182d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Darstellung eines chronologischen Ablaufs auf einem senkrechten oder waagrechten Streifen (d. h. auf einer Linie), bestückt mit Daten beziehungsweise Jahreszahlen, zu denen sich wichtige Geschehnisse ereignet haben oder ereignen sollen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b9989c4-8a88-419d-9b11-18200cfd5440",
                                "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                                "text": "Anhand eines Zeitstreifens kann beispielsweise die Entwicklungsgeschichte der Menschheit dargestellt werden."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a97b5c20-08c7-4314-9724-9caf3deb5039",
                                "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                                "text": "Die geschichtlichen Ereignisse werden dem Zeitstreifen zugeordnet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f75944b2-37ae-4459-b5ab-f0a08ceb196f",
                                "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                                "text": "Dies soll aufgegriffen werden, indem den Kindern ein Zeitstreifen zur Verfügung gestellt wird."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ac1b6ab-5971-4dd8-bf1e-94d0b1c1b1a9",
                                "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                                "text": "Eine Infografik muss sich dem Inhalt entsprechend entfalten können: etwa als langer Zeitstreifen auf dem Fuß mehrerer Seiten oder freigestellt über das ganze Format."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "670f2fbf-cf4e-429a-b279-78eb42a4327e",
                                "sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                                "text": "[…] je mehr sie in Epochengrenzen bloß geordnete Konventionen sehen, desto schwächer müssen die Einwände gegen die einfache und formale Lösung ausfallen, von chronologischen Zeitstreifen von je hundert Kalenderjahren auszugehen."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a2ec7f9f-309e-49ff-83b3-e05bc8c93555",
                        "source_entry_id": "cdf586e1-c1e0-37ba-a457-1d3a8f0c182d",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7472d3c-4c50-3221-8725-71ee7803e15a",
                        "source_sense_description": "Darstellung eines chronologischen Ablaufs auf einem senkrechten oder waagrechten Streifen",
                        "target_lang_word": "timeline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "timeline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8bc18d7-78a5-32d3-bbe0-f1f1ef66bc8f",
                                        "entry_id": "c770469b-eb51-32f6-81cc-73459a2119a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A graphical representation of a chronological sequence of events (past or future)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "482ddc40-4309-4775-a203-089e4851d817",
                                                "sense_id": "a8bc18d7-78a5-32d3-bbe0-f1f1ef66bc8f",
                                                "text": "I got bitches askin' me about the code for the Wi-Fi / So they can talk about they timeline / And show me pictures of they friends"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46d53d58-8708-43e8-8813-bdd94490927e",
                                                "sense_id": "a8bc18d7-78a5-32d3-bbe0-f1f1ef66bc8f",
                                                "text": "But, as things stand, there's no timeline in place for reopening."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09c024e9-bb40-390b-8f6c-09d7f01909c0",
                                        "entry_id": "c770469b-eb51-32f6-81cc-73459a2119a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A schedule of activities; a timetable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e684628f-da74-3caa-a934-0bc58563214f",
                                        "entry_id": "c770469b-eb51-32f6-81cc-73459a2119a1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An individual universe or reality, especially a parallel/alternate one in which events differ from actual history, or differ from the established canon of a fictional world."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44b9235a-5433-4c3f-8b00-18b2be391475",
                                                "sense_id": "e684628f-da74-3caa-a934-0bc58563214f",
                                                "text": "on an alternate timeline"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b1eee33-a12e-4359-a500-ef2ce4c6d2ee",
                                                "sense_id": "e684628f-da74-3caa-a934-0bc58563214f",
                                                "text": "SISKO: I don't quite know how to say this... but now that we know about the accident that sent the ship back in time, we should be able to avoid it.\nWORF: Well if we do that, your timeline will collapse and everything here will cease to exist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad4fb955-b829-447b-9d51-1df9a2591ebe",
                                                "sense_id": "e684628f-da74-3caa-a934-0bc58563214f",
                                                "text": "So in that sense, if we want to talk about the timeline of what it would mean for Trump to be winning and reshifting the Constitutional order, part of what I think about is: If the neoliberal order is cracked, as Gerstle says it is, then the question is: What will succeed it?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
